    "enUS": {
      "description": "The drawing is composed of rough, broad, strokes and seems to depict a large bird of prey. Despite the simple composition, the artist clearly viewed this creature with fear and awe. An expert on big game could likely tell you more.",
      "dialogue": {
        "ec97a047cfea4d6c4f9e": "Got something for me, $c?",
        "f62f36e3fc0ac641c9cd": "Well now. This is certainly interesting..."
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Primitive Drawing to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn Vale.",
